{"title": "Guardian of Faith (passive feature)", "pageid": 17297, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Guardian_of_Faith_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the passive feature used by <a href=\"/wiki/Guardian_of_Faith_(creature)\" title=\"Guardian of Faith (creature)\">Guardians of Faith</a>. For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Guardian_of_Faith_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Guardian of Faith (disambiguation)\">Guardian of Faith (disambiguation)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Guardian_of_Faith.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Guardian_of_Faith.webp/300px-Guardian_of_Faith.webp, /w/images/b/b1/Guardian_of_Faith.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Guardian_of_Faith.webp/300px-Guardian_of_Faith.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Guardian_of_Faith.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Guardian of Faith</b> is a passive feature used by the <a href=\"/wiki/Guardian_of_Faith_(creature)\" title=\"Guardian of Faith (creature)\">summons of the same name</a>. It allows them to automatically attack enemies entering their range with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strike_of_the_Guardian\" title=\"Strike of the Guardian\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp/20px-Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp/30px-Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp/40px-Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Strike of the Guardian\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp/20px-Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Sacred_Flame_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strike_of_the_Guardian\" title=\"Strike of the Guardian\">Strike of the Guardian</a>. This is the inverse of how <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attacks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Opportunity Attacks\">Opportunity Attacks</a> normally work.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When an enemy enters your attack range, you can strike them. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Guardian_of_Faith_(creature)\" title=\"Guardian of Faith (creature)\">Guardian of Faith (creature)</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This does not require a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> resource and thus can trigger multiple times per turn.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714230328\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 747/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5118/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3295/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 187/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 864600/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.259      1 -total\n 98.13%   31.657      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 52.36%   16.890      1 Template:PageSeo\n 51.45%   16.597      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 31.55%   10.179      1 Template:SmSAI\n 12.05%    3.887      1 Template:Icon_link\n 11.02%    3.555      1 Template:Icon_text\n 10.42%    3.361      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  8.82%    2.844      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  8.17%    2.635      1 Template:R\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:17297-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714230328 and revision id 296883. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}